{
    "title": "CoinOut Receipts & Rewards App",
    "description": "Don't throw out your receipts when you can earn free rewards for them! <font color=\"blue\"><b>Scan your paper receipts and online order e-receipts to fetch rewards with the CoinOut receipt scanner app.</b></font>\r\n\r\n<b>Earn valuable gift cards and rewards just for scanning and submitting your everyday paper and online order receipts.</b> Easily submit and scan receipts, earn Coins, and fetch rewards directly in the CoinOut receipt scanner app for great rewards.\r\n\r\n<b>GET REWARDED FOR YOUR PAPER RECEIPTS</b>\r\nSnap a photo of any valid paper receipt and start earning BIG on CoinOut. Receipts can be from any retailer or store in the US and must be submitted within 14 days of the purchase date. The more paper receipts you scan and submit, the more Coins you earn! Fetch rewards directly for your paper receipts from the CoinOut receipt scanner app.\r\n\r\n<b>EARN REWARDS AUTOMATICALLY FOR BUYING ONLINE</b>\r\nConnect your email and other retailer accounts to earn rewards automatically for your online purchases. You\u2019ll receive Coins for each order and will earn connection bonuses when linking your different accounts. Receive a 200 Coins bonus just for connecting your first email account!\r\n\r\n<b>INTRODUCING MISSIONS \u2013 A NEW WAY TO EARN MORE COINS!</b>\r\nExciting news! We're thrilled to introduce a fantastic way for you to boost your rewards with CoinOut \u2013 say hello to Missions! Simply head over to the Missions tab, where you can easily complete fun tasks like taking surveys to earn even more Coins. It's a simple and enjoyable way to maximize your rewards!\r\n\r\n<b>REDEEM COINS FOR REWARDS</b>\r\nYou can get your first reward for as little as 3,000 Coins. Redeem your Coins for great rewards like Amazon gift codes, PayPal, and Zelle. Connect your email, retailer accounts, complete your profile surveys, and you\u2019ll be well on your way to earning rewards and gift cards from CoinOut! Scan receipts, fetch rewards and earn gift cards directly in the CoinOut receipt scanner app.\r\n\r\n<b>LEVEL UP AND EARN EVEN MORE COINS</b>\r\nWith five reward levels, you\u2019re in control of your earning power. When you reach higher reward levels, you\u2019ll increase the number of Coins that you can earn for each receipt and online order. The higher your reward level, the more Coins you earn for each receipt or online order. Along the way, collect badges and instant win game plays to earn even more!\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<font color=\"blue\"><b>Start earning rewards and gift cards today with the CoinOut receipt scanner app! Turn your paper receipts and online order e-receipts into rewards and gift cards!</b></font>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Don&#39;t throw out your receipts when you can earn free rewards for them! <font color=\"blue\"><b>Scan your paper receipts and online order e-receipts to fetch rewards with the CoinOut receipt scanner app.</b></font><br><br><b>Earn valuable gift cards and rewards just for scanning and submitting your everyday paper and online order receipts.</b> Easily submit and scan receipts, earn Coins, and fetch rewards directly in the CoinOut receipt scanner app for great rewards.<br><br><b>GET REWARDED FOR YOUR PAPER RECEIPTS</b><br>Snap a photo of any valid paper receipt and start earning BIG on CoinOut. Receipts can be from any retailer or store in the US and must be submitted within 14 days of the purchase date. The more paper receipts you scan and submit, the more Coins you earn! Fetch rewards directly for your paper receipts from the CoinOut receipt scanner app.<br><br><b>EARN REWARDS AUTOMATICALLY FOR BUYING ONLINE</b><br>Connect your email and other retailer accounts to earn rewards automatically for your online purchases. You\u2019ll receive Coins for each order and will earn connection bonuses when linking your different accounts. Receive a 200 Coins bonus just for connecting your first email account!<br><br><b>INTRODUCING MISSIONS \u2013 A NEW WAY TO EARN MORE COINS!</b><br>Exciting news! We&#39;re thrilled to introduce a fantastic way for you to boost your rewards with CoinOut \u2013 say hello to Missions! Simply head over to the Missions tab, where you can easily complete fun tasks like taking surveys to earn even more Coins. It&#39;s a simple and enjoyable way to maximize your rewards!<br><br><b>REDEEM COINS FOR REWARDS</b><br>You can get your first reward for as little as 3,000 Coins. Redeem your Coins for great rewards like Amazon gift codes, PayPal, and Zelle. Connect your email, retailer accounts, complete your profile surveys, and you\u2019ll be well on your way to earning rewards and gift cards from CoinOut! Scan receipts, fetch rewards and earn gift cards directly in the CoinOut receipt scanner app.<br><br><b>LEVEL UP AND EARN EVEN MORE COINS</b><br>With five reward levels, you\u2019re in control of your earning power. When you reach higher reward levels, you\u2019ll increase the number of Coins that you can earn for each receipt and online order. The higher your reward level, the more Coins you earn for each receipt or online order. Along the way, collect badges and instant win game plays to earn even more!<br><br>---<br><br><font color=\"blue\"><b>Start earning rewards and gift cards today with the CoinOut receipt scanner app! Turn your paper receipts and online order e-receipts into rewards and gift cards!</b></font>",
